---
import './teste.css';
---

<div>
	<main>
		<section class="hero">
            <div class="hero_container">
                <img src="/hero.jpg" alt="Hero Image" class="hero_img" />

				<div class="hero_content">
                    <h1>Propositum Formarum</h1>
				    <span>Your reference manager, free, open source and offline...</span>
                    
                    <a href="https://github.com/jeovabastos/propositum_formarum/releases/download/v1.0.0/propositum_formarum_1.0.0_amd64.AppImage" target="_blank">DOWNLOAD</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/jeovabastos/propositum_formarum" target="_blank">SOURCE CODE</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
        <section>
            <h2>What</h2>
            
            <p>The digital asset manager for your projects!</p>
            <p>Organize your references, then filter by tags and colors. Use the moodboard mode for ideation and place the app as "always on top" as a window with your thoughts. No account required, no internet connection required, open source and free for all time, that's it!</p>
    
            <ul>
                <li>Download the appImage</li>
                <li>Execute the appImage</li>
                <li>Import folders from your computer</li>
                <li>The app will index the folder's images and create thumbnails, showing them with pagination</li>									
                <li><a href="#features_container">See all features!</a></li>							
            </ul>            
        </section>

		<section  id="features_container">
            <h2>Features</h2>
    
            <ul class="features_container">
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Index all images from your folders</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_importar_imagens.gif" alt="Index all images from your folders"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Add/remove notes to/from an image</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_add_notas.gif" alt="Add/remove notes to/from an image"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Select "n" images and add/remove tags</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_add_tags_to_n_images.gif" alt="Select n images"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Filter images by tag/tags</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_filter_by_tag.gif" alt="Filter images by tag/tags"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Filter images by colors</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_filter_by_color.gif" alt="Filter images by colors"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Enter the study mode with filtered images</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_studymode_with_filtered_images.gif" alt="Enter the study mode with filtered images"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Write in moodboards with SVGs</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_moodboard_SVGs.gif" alt="Add/remove moodboards and manage ideation assets"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Add images to moodboard</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_moodboard_import_n_images.gif" alt="Add/remove moodboards and manage ideation assets"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Pan movement in moodboard</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_moodboard_pan_movement.gif" alt="Add/remove moodboards and manage ideation assets"/>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Save and load moodboards</p>
                        <img loading="lazy" src="/public/features/feature_moodboard_save_and_load.gif" alt="Add/remove moodboards and manage ideation assets"/>
                    </div>
                </li>                           
            </ul>
        </section>

		<section>
			<h2>How</h2>

			<p>Stack used in the project until now</p>

			<ul>
				<li>Tauri v.2 (rust)</li>
				<li>Sqlite</li>				
				<li>React</li>
				<li>Typescript</li>
				<li>rust libraries [sqlx, tokio, walkdir, images, kmeans, pallete]</li>												
			</ul>
		</section>

        <footer>
            <img src="/public/footer.jpg"/>
        </footer>
	</main>
</div>
